---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for interpretSymptoms. Read the request and prior attempts to separate observations from the requester’s diagnosis. Identify approved handling restrictions and information needed for safe routing, without inventing technical causes or giving unqualified hazardous repair instructions. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
